{
  "type": "VStack",
  "properties": {
    "spacing": 16,
    "alignment": "leading",
    "padding": "default"
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "Text",
      "properties": { "text": "WebView - Remote URL", "font": "headline" }
    },
    {
      "type": "Text",
      "properties": {
        "text": "Loads swift.org in the native android.webkit.WebView with pinch-to-zoom enabled.",
        "font": "subheadline",
        "foregroundStyle": "secondary"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WebView",
      "id": 1,
      "properties": {
        "url": "https://www.swift.org",
        "magnificationGestures": true,
        "frame": { "height": 320 },
        "cornerRadius": 10
      }
    },

    { "type": "Divider" },

    {
      "type": "Text",
      "properties": { "text": "WebView - Local HTML + JS Injection", "font": "headline" }
    },
    {
      "type": "Text",
      "properties": {
        "text": "Inline HTML with two userScripts from assets: webview-inject-start.js (documentStart) and webview-inject-end.js (documentEnd). On Android, documentStart is approximated via onPageStarted, so a fast inline page can finish parsing first - the banner reports what actually happened.",
        "font": "subheadline",
        "foregroundStyle": "secondary"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WebView",
      "id": 2,
      "properties": {
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>ActionUI Demo</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:sans-serif;margin:0;padding:16px;background:#f5f5f7;color:#1c1c1e}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}h2{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px}p{font-size:14px;color:#555;margin:6px 0}code{font-family:monospace;background:#f0f0f5;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px}#actionui-banner{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;border:1px solid #d1d1d6;background:#f0f0f0;color:#555;margin-bottom:12px}</style></head><body><div class='card'><h2>ActionUI WebView Demo</h2><div id='actionui-banner'>Waiting for documentEnd injection&#8230;</div><p>window.actionUI.injectedAtStart: <code id='start-flag'>checking&#8230;</code></p><p>window.actionUI.framework: <code id='framework'>checking&#8230;</code></p><script>var ai=window.actionUI;document.getElementById('start-flag').textContent=ai&&ai.injectedAtStart?'true':'not set';document.getElementById('framework').textContent=ai&&ai.framework?ai.framework:'not set';</script></div><div class='card'><h2>About this demo</h2><p>The page content is defined inline in <code>WebView.json</code>.</p><p>Two scripts are injected from app assets via <code>userScripts</code>:</p><p><code>webview-inject-start.js</code> at documentStart</p><p><code>webview-inject-end.js</code> at documentEnd</p></div></body></html>",
        "userScripts": [
          {
            "injectionTime": "documentStart",
            "resourceName": "webview-inject-start.js",
            "forMainFrameOnly": false
          },
          {
            "injectionTime": "documentEnd",
            "resourceName": "webview-inject-end.js",
            "forMainFrameOnly": false
          }
        ],
        "frame": { "height": 380 },
        "cornerRadius": 10
      }
    }
  ]
}
